{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Kanban Notes &amp; Tasks》是一款針對 iOS 的看板專案管理 App，適合軟件開發、市場推廣、產品規劃、活動籌備及個人目標管理等使用者。它結合靈活看板、任務優先級、自訂欄位與團隊協作，協助把工作流程視覺化並保持有序。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-70.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>靈活看板與任務管理</h2>\n<p>Boardly 提供可自訂的無限看板，支援拖放欄目、任務優先級、到期日篩選、子任務進度、標籤及全文搜尋。使用者亦可建立文字、日期、選項與網址等自訂欄位，加入檔案、圖片、PDF 和語音附件，並透過 CloudKit 分享看板及設定讀取或編輯權限。資料以本機及 iCloud 為先，離線可操作，連線後自動同步，方便團隊保持項目有序。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-120-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-121-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-122-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-123-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-124-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-125-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Kanban Notes &amp; Tasks – Boardly</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/kanban-notes-tasks-boardly/id6752723058?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:09.491142+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:57:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:40.793189+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:30.785862+00:00","content_hash":"4b801093aafec2f901d4a10a70d377e3fd767f90060a0185e091a63e28202af1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}